"dat Teelbild fast. Grötter Weerten maakt disse Enkelheiten scharp."

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:143
msgid "Anisotropy:"
msgstr "Richtenafhangigkeit:"

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:147
msgid ""
"<p>Anisotropic (directional) modifier of the details. Keep it small for "
"Gaussian noise."
msgstr ""
"<p>Richtenafhangen Modifikator för Enkelheiten. Laat em lütt, vun wegen dat "
"Gauß'sche Rusen."

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:152
msgid "Smoothing:"
msgstr "Weekheit:"

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:156
msgid ""
"<p>Total smoothing power: if Detail Factor sets the relative smoothing and "
"Anisotropy Factor the direction, Smoothing Factor sets the overall effect."
msgstr ""
"<p>Heel Weekmaak-Stärk: Wenn de Enkelheiten-Faktor dat relative Weekmaken "
"fastleggt, un de Richtafhangigkeit de Richt, denn leggt de Weekmaak-Faktor den "
"Heeleffekt fast."

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:162
msgid "Regularity:"
msgstr "Evenheit:"

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:166
msgid ""
"<p>This value controls the evenness of smoothing to the image. Do not use a "
"high value here, or the target image will be completely blurred."
msgstr ""
"<p>Disse Weert stüert de Weekmaak-Evenheit vun dat Bild. Bruuk hier keen hogen "
"Weert, anners warrt dat Teelbild heel verwischt."

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:172
msgid "Iterations:"
msgstr "Wedderhalen:"

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:175
msgid "<p>Sets the number of times the filter is applied over the image."
msgstr "<p>Leggt fast, wo faken de Filter för dat Bild bruukt warrt."

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:180
msgid "Noise:"
msgstr "Rusen:"

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:184
msgid "<p>Sets the noise scale."
msgstr "<p>Leggt den Ruusweert fast."

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:193
#: utilities/setup/setupicc.cpp:306
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Verwiedert Instellen"

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:195
msgid "Angular step:"
msgstr "Winkelschritt:"

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:199
msgid ""
"<p>Set here the angular integration step in degrees in analogy to anisotropy."
msgstr ""
"<p>Leggt den Integratschoon-Winkelschritt in Graad fast, liek as de "
"Richtenafhangigkeit."

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:204
msgid "Integral step:"
msgstr "Integraalschritt:"

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:208
msgid "<p>Set here the spatial integral step."
msgstr "<p>Leggt den Ruum-Integraalschritt fast."

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:212
msgid "Gaussian:"
msgstr "Gauß-Weert:"

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:216
msgid "<p>Set here the precision of the Gaussian function."
msgstr "<p>Leggt de Nauigkeit vun de Gauss'sche Funkschoon fast."

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:220
msgid "Tile size:"
msgstr "Kachelgrött:"

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:223
msgid "<p>Sets the size of tile."
msgstr "<p>Leggt de Grött vun de Kachel fast."

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:227
msgid "Tile border:"
msgstr "Kachelrand:"

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:230
msgid "<p>Sets the size of tile borders."
msgstr "<p>Leggt de Grött vun de Kachelränners fast."

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:234
msgid "Interpolation:"
msgstr "Estemeren:"

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:236
msgid "Nearest Neighbor"
msgstr "Neegst Naver"

#: imageplugins/hotpixels/imageeffect_hotpixels.cpp:95
#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:237
msgid "Linear"
msgstr "Lineaar"

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:238
msgid "Runge-Kutta"
msgstr "Runge-Kutta"

#: libs/greycstoration/greycstorationwidget.cpp:239
msgid "<p>Select the right interpolation method to set the image quality."
msgstr ""
"<p>Hier kannst Du de Estemeermetood utsöken, se leggt de Bildgööd fast."

